#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:21
msgid "No keys"
msgstr "没有 key"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:22
msgid ""
"The source text is the message; ids are content hashes managed for you in "
"PO files."
msgstr "源文本就是消息本身；id 是内容哈希，由 PO 文件替你管理。"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:25
msgid "No runtime"
msgstr "没有运行时"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:26
msgid ""
"Messages compile to ternaries or plain literals. Unused messages tree-shake "
"with the code that used them."
msgstr "消息编译为三元表达式或纯字符串字面量。未使用的消息随使用它的代码一起被 tree-shake 掉。"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:29
msgid "PO workflow"
msgstr "PO 工作流"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:30
msgid ""
"messages.pot + <locale>.po — the format translators, TMSes and LLMs already "
"understand."
msgstr "messages.pot + <locale>.po——翻译者、TMS 和 LLM 早已熟悉的格式。"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:33
msgid "SSR-safe"
msgstr "SSR 安全"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:34
msgid ""
"The server locale lives in AsyncLocalStorage per request; no isolation "
"means an error, never shared state."
msgstr "服务端 locale 按请求存放在 AsyncLocalStorage 里；无法隔离时直接报错，绝不共享状态。"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:42
msgid ""
"Compile-time i18n. Write the source text inline; the compiler inlines every "
"translation at the call site — no runtime catalog, no lookup, nothing to "
"load."
msgstr "编译期 i18n。源文本直接写在代码里；编译器把每条翻译内联到调用处——没有运行时 catalog，没有查找，没有任何需要加载的东西。"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:49
msgid "Get started"
msgstr "开始使用"

#: src/app/[lang]/layout.tsx:23
msgid ""
"Compile-time i18n: no keys, no runtime, no catalog to load. Translations "
"inline at the call site."
msgstr "编译期 i18n：没有 key，没有运行时，没有需要加载的 catalog。翻译内联在调用处。"
